# Keep aider's repo-map small (gitignore syntax) → fewer tokens, faster.
# The local executor has a 16K context ceiling; see local-ai-setup/README.md.

# cdk8s-generated API bindings: 1601 files, ~107k lines (~89% of this repo).
# Regenerated by `cdk8s import`, never hand-edited.
workloads/imports/

# SOPS-encrypted material — no reason to ever hand it to a model.
secrets/

# Assets, not code. homelab-arch.excalidraw alone is ~244k tokens.
assets/
docs/static/

node_modules/
dist/
build/
vendor/
*.lock
*.min.*
go.work.sum
